{"unit_id":"zriyox__dsh-goal-scaffold#card-zh","repo":"zriyox/dsh-goal-scaffold","commit":"5e1a1ae8528e05bd74fc7710f90be38f9d371072","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-goal-scaffold 是一个面向 DSH 的长任务规划插件，在 agent/pre-step 阶段检查用户消息，并在检测到较长且带有范围信号的任务时询问是否先规划。用户选择规划后，它让代理先创建含可验证验收条件的 plan.md、设置最多五轮的目标并逐项执行；也可选择直接开始或本会话不再询问。它只处理用户消息，每个会话最多询问一次；没有用户提问服务时会直接放行。配置可控制开关、最小消息长度和额外信号词。适合希望在大型编码任务开始前明确计划和验收条件的 DSH 用户，不需要 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:139-197","cordis.patch.yml:2-4"]}
{"unit_id":"zriyox__dsh-goal-scaffold#card-en","repo":"zriyox/dsh-goal-scaffold","commit":"5e1a1ae8528e05bd74fc7710f90be38f9d371072","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-goal-scaffold detects broad DSH requests and asks whether to plan first. If approved, it directs the agent to write an acceptance checklist in plan.md and create a goal capped at five rounds. It prompts once per session and passes through without a question service. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:139-197","cordis.patch.yml:2-4"]}
